    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100133" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξ-ετάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>search out and examine along with</i> or
			<i>together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				900d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm. Math.</u>
				14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be reckoned with</i> or <i>among</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ συνεξεταζόμενοι μετά τινος</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> his <i>party</i> or
				<i>adherents</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.127
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				190
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pr. Im.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; but also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξετάζεσθαί τινι</span>
			<i>measure oneself with</i> one, <i>rival</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.54
			</span></i>.</div>
